\title{2. The itemised tables}

\subtree{
\title{2.1 Level 1: where the 8 cores are}

\p{The timed pass of each process (section 1.3). "JVM" is the launcher \code{\verb~|rlvm-jvm~}, "image" the executable \code{\verb~|rlvm~}; both without any option but \code{\verb~|--threads 8~}.}

